package broker_test

// End-to-end tests driven by a stock third-party MQTT 5 client (Eclipse
// Paho). Nothing saguin-specific reaches the wire, which is the point:
// the same packets `mosquitto_pub` sends produce the same results.
//
// These assert the failures, not only the happy paths. A queue that
// silently delivered one job to two workers would pass every
// happy-path test in the file.

